1
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,085
MOM: I know that sound. That's a plate.

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:09,531
Welcome to SHHH! Don't Wake Mom.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:14,574
Four siblings. One sleeping Mom. A whole house of chores.

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,701
Pick your look.

5
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:21,643
Then play solo against bot siblings, or open a room and play with a friend online.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,355
Every job is hands-on.

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,992
Press the toy chest open, and sort the blocks by colour.

8
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,676
Pump soap onto the sponge,

9
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:45,527
hold the plate, and scrub until it's actually clean.

10
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:55,717
Open the fridge by its handle. Groceries go on the shelves.

11
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,368
Lift the bin lid. In goes the trash.

12
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:13,455
Hold the blanket with one hand, and rub with the other to fold it.

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,410
Hop from room to room with a finger gun, while your siblings race you to every job.

14
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:40,791
Your watch shows the clock, your points, and how close Mom is to waking up.

15
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:43,232
Sneakily mess up a rival's job,

16
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:45,278
but someone may be watching.

17
00:01:49,050 --> 00:01:50,424
The pets don't help.

18
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:03,710
Every clink, crash and bang wakes Mom up a little more.

19
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,221
MOM: I am getting up. I am really getting up.

20
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,920
And when Mom is up, she wants a name.

21
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:13,951
MOM: Alright... who did this? Show me.

22
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:16,672
Point at a sibling. Or blame the cat.

23
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:20,254
Saw a sibling mess with your job? Show Mom.

24
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,973
Then, clean up the evidence.

25
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:34,144
When the clock hits zero, the most helpful kid wins.

26
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:40,352
MOM: ...the quietest, most helpful kid in this house. I'm SO proud. Now everybody... SLEEP!

27
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:48,016
Shhh. Don't wake Mom.
